WEBVTT

NOTE One A.M. (1916) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
[music]

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:37.750
"They should build these
handles nearer the door"

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.250
"I never did like taxis"

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.750
"Where's my key?"

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.000
"I must have a skate on"

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:26.250
"That's the fastest round
of drinks I ever saw"

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.750
"What detained you?"

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:43.000
"This has been done"

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.500
"Good night!"

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:27.250
"If I knew how to
yodel I'd make it!"

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:18.000
"I'll try another route"

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:37.750
"Light exercise"

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:50.500
"Where's that bed?"
